<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        This Cookie Policy explains how <%= siteTitle %> uses cookies and similar technologies on our website. By using our site, you consent to the use of cookies as described below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help the site remember your preferences, improve performance, and deliver relevant content and advertisements.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> Required for the website to function, such as remembering your theme preference.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> Help us understand how visitors use the site, if enabled.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising cookies:</strong> Used by third-party ad partners such as Google AdSense to serve relevant ads, if enabled.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">If advertising is enabled, partners like Google may use cookies to personalize ads and measure ad performance. Please review <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Google’s Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Managing Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">You can manage, disable, or delete cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect site functionality, including advertising and theme preferences.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. Consent</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">By continuing to use <%= siteTitle %>, you consent to our use of cookies. You can change your cookie preferences at any time through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We may update this Cookie Policy to reflect changes in technology or legal requirements. Continued use of the service after updates means you accept the revised policy.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">7. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">For questions about this policy, visit the <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Contact</a> page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
